    "message": "Complete any sub-plan requirements that apply to you: Comprehensive, Social Justice/Applied Drama, Directing/Dramaturgy/Playwriting/Criticism, Design/Technology, Acting & Performance. Verify this requirement with your advisor or APAS."
   }
  }
